治裝舟艦。傅亮與晦書曰：「薄伐河朔，事猶未已，朝野之慮，憂懼者多。」又言：「朝士多諫北征，上當遣外監萬幼宗往相諮訪。」時朝廷處分異常，其謀頗泄。三年正月，晦弟黃門侍郎㬭馳使告晦，晦猶謂不然，呼諮議參軍何承天，示以亮書，曰：「計幼宗一二日必至，傅公慮我好事，故先遣此書。」承天曰：「外間所聞，咸謂西討已定，幼宗豈有上理。」晦尚謂虛妄，使承天豫立答詔啟草，言伐虜宜須明年。江夏內史程道惠得尋陽人書，言「朝廷將有大處分，其事已審」，使其輔國府中兵參軍樂冏封以示晦。晦又謂承天曰：「幼宗尚未至，若復二三日無消息，便是不復來邪？」承天答曰：「詔使本無來理，如程所說，其事已判，豈容復疑。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王華","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:u0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"二女","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"二女未名。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"義康","person_id":"e9f_a95_f00","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按該句的發言、官屬及敘述主體辨識。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"義賓","person_id":"1f5_x7z_phn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按該句的發言、官屬及敘述主體辨識。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"曹","person_id":"51t_1pv_7q6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"世休","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"羨之","person_id":"4y6_myv_ojh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p007:m0078","start":78,"end":79,"surface":"晦","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-dig